# The demo-app archive. Marked binary so Git never attempts a textual diff or
# a line-ending rewrite on it — `apps-demo.manifest.txt` beside it is what a
# reviewer reads to see which demo files changed. See docs/APPS_REPO.md.
apps-demo.zip binary

# Line-ending policy.
#
# The repo is otherwise checked out per each machine's core.autocrlf.
# npm rewrites every app package.json with LF on each `npm install`
# (propagate / install:apps), which under core.autocrlf=true shows up
# as a phantom CRLF↔LF "modification" with no content change. `apps/` is no
# longer tracked (it is packed into apps-demo.zip), so the rule below is inert
# today; it is kept so a future re-tracking of the tree does not reintroduce
# the churn.
apps/**/package.json text eol=lf
# Vitest snapshots are content-stable; CRLF on Windows otherwise shows phantom diffs.
**/*.snap text eol=lf
